OL,4,BArteta says Arsenal need more luck to  
OL,5,Bkill off games                         
OL,6,GIt might be emerging more as a theme   
OL,7,Gthan as a major problem, but in recent 
OL,8,Gweeks Arsenal cannot seem to finish    
OL,9,Goff matches when they are on top.      
OL,11,FIn their past nine outings across all  
OL,12,Fcompetitions, just once have the       
OL,13,FGunners won a game by more than a      
OL,14,Fsingle goal.                           
